Z||000014||Hartz||12-09-2001||01:41 PM||||OK, I know nothing about this car other than what I've read, and yes, it does look nice, but did anyone else notice that it has the correct tach for an '85 SE with a V6, but the speedometer is for a 4 cylinder?  Given that the low milage is a key selling feature, I think I would look this one over VERY carefully before I bought it...   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_watchout.gif"><P>Hartz<P>'84 SC 5.7L V8<BR>'85 SE 3.1L V6 Turbo<BR>hartzfeld.home.mindspring.com||||reg||1
